# ...but the screenshot sets ARE a graded deliverable (AC-15, PDF Part 3).
# The bare `*.png` rule above is what a handout image needs; without this
# negation `git add artifacts/` silently skips every captured viewport and the
# whole visual evidence set never reaches `main`. Keep the two in sync.
!artifacts/**/*.png

# instructor-provided course handouts (never commit)
